---
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro'

---
<section id="about" class="about">
  <Container class="about__container">
    <div class="about__section">
      <div data-about-image class="about__image">
        <img src="images/about-1.png" alt="" srcset="">
      </div>

      <div class="about__content">
        <h3 class="about__title">I’m a passionate developer</h3>

        <p class="about__text">
          My journey in software development began in secondary school, where I 
          developed a strong interest in programming and computer science. During 
          high school, I explored technologies such as React, Redux, Zustand, 
          TypeScript, Angular, Next.js, Node.js, NestJS, RxJS, CSS, SCSS, Gulp, 
          and Webpack, building projects and expanding my skills.
        </p>

        <p class="about__text">
          By the 10th grade, I started working as a freelance developer, gaining 
          hands-on experience through real-world projects and direct client 
          collaboration. This taught me how to understand business requirements, 
          communicate with clients, and deliver practical solutions.
        </p>
        
        <p class="about__text">
          I am passionate about technology, algorithms, and continuous learning, 
          always seeking new tools and approaches to improve my work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__section">
      <div data-about-image class="about__image">
        <img src="images/about-2.png" alt="" srcset="">
      </div>

      <div class="about__content">
        <h3 class="about__title">
          I like giving&nbsp;presentations 
          at&nbsp;public&nbsp;events and&nbsp;conferences
        </h3>

        <p class="about__text">
          I have experience giving presentations at public events and conferences 
          on topics related to software development, artificial intelligence, and 
          programming. I enjoy sharing knowledge with others and explaining 
          technical concepts in a clear and accessible way.
        </p>

        <p class="about__text">
          These presentations helped me improve my communication and public 
          speaking skills, as well as my ability to structure complex ideas 
          and present them to different audiences. I value the opportunity 
          to contribute to the tech community and engage with other 
          developers and enthusiasts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__section">
      <div data-about-image class="about__image">
        <img src="images/about-3.png" alt="" srcset="">
      </div>

      <div class="about__content">
        <h3 class="about__title">I enjoy hackathons and&nbsp;competitions</h3>

        <p class="about__text">
          I am highly motivated by participation in hackathons and programming 
          competitions, where I enjoy solving real-world problems under time 
          constraints and collaborating with other developers. These 
          experiences help me strengthen my problem-solving skills, 
          think creatively under pressure, and continuously improve 
          as a developer.
        </p>

        <p class="about__text">
          During university, I also participated in programming competitions, 
          where I achieved top places multiple times. In addition, during high 
          school I was awarded in mathematical olympiads at the city level, 
          which further developed my analytical thinking and ability to 
          approach complex problems systematically. These achievements 
          reflect my strong interest in mathematics, algorithms, and 
          logical reasoning, which I actively apply in software development.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<script>
  import { clamp } from '@/shared/utils/math'

  const aboutImages: Array<HTMLElement> = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-about-image]'))
  const maxDeviation = 0.15

  updateAboutImages()

  window.addEventListener('scroll', updateAboutImages)
  window.addEventListener('resize', updateAboutImages)

  function updateAboutImages() {
    aboutImages.forEach(image => {
      const { top } = image.getBoundingClientRect()
      const deviationRatio = clamp(-1, top / window.innerHeight, 1)

      const deviation = deviationRatio * maxDeviation
      image.style.transform = `translateY(${deviation * 100}%)`
    })
  }
  
</script>

<style is:global>
  .about__section {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 80px 0px;

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 80px;
  }
  .about__section:nth-child(even) {
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }
  .about__content {
    flex: 0 1 auto;
  }
  .about__title {
    font-size: 50px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
  }
  .about__text {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--base-400);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .about__image {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 50%;
    flex: 1 0 100%;

    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;

    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .about__image img {
    display: block;
    max-height: 80vh;
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .about__section,
    .about__section:nth-child(even) {
      padding: 30px 0px;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 30px;
    }
    .about__image {
      max-width: 100%;
      transform: none !important;
    }
    .about__title {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .about__text {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-align: left;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }
  }
</style>
